<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Our Lead Connection Service bridges the gap between data leads and inbound calls — we pre-qualify leads for you and transfer them to your team in real time.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">This approach delivers transfers at a lower cost than inbound calls and 20–30% higher bind rates than data leads alone.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Could this be a fit for your sales process?</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">– {{{Sender.FirstName}}} {{{Sender.Phone}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
